// TypeScript configuration for type-checking spec files in @lfx-one/shared.
//
// The base tsconfig.json excludes spec files because `tsc` (the emit build) must not
// compile them into dist. The vitest runs are transpile-only (esbuild), and
// apps/lfx-one/tsconfig.spec.json only covers apps/lfx-one/src, so without this
// config, shared spec fixtures are type-checked by nothing — a required field added to
// a shared interface silently desyncs every fixture typed against it (see #2709 for the
// PR review where this was caught by hand). Wire this file into check-types so the emit
// build stays clean and specs still fail loudly when interfaces drift.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true
  },
  "include": ["src/**/*"],
  "exclude": ["dist", "node_modules"]
}
